  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.messageCompletedString>{PAWN_nameDef} ha desactivat l'obelisc correctament.</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.messageCompletedString>
  
